  "content": [
    {
      "text": "now will my husband dwell with me, Gen. 30:20. a sanctuary; that I may dwell among them, Ex. 25:8. I will dwell among the children of Israel, Ex. 29:45 (1 Kgs. 6:13). beloved of the Lord shall dwell in safety, Deut. 33:12. I will dwell in the house of the Lord for ever, Ps. 23:6 (27:4). my rest for ever: here will I dwell, Ps. 132:14. better to dwell in a corner of the housetop, Prov. 21:9 (25:24). wolf also shall dwell with the lamb, Isa. 11:6 (2 Ne. 30:12). Ariel, the city where David dwelt, Isa. 29:1. I am the Lord your God dwelling in Zion, Joel 3:17. built houses … but ye shall not dwell in them, Amos 5:11. I will dwell in the midst of thee, Zech. 2:10.",
